# =====================================================================
# Large outputs: regenerated by the scripts, never committed
# =====================================================================
# The fitted model objects. results/real/fits.rds is 2.9 GB and is
# rebuilt by 60_real_data.R in about an hour; the ladder and strategy
# fits by 79_detection_ladder.R and 74_strategy_check_msom.R. They are
# outputs, not inputs: the INLA fits are deterministic, so nothing in
# them fails to follow from the data and the code.
results/real/fits.rds
results/**/*fits*.rds

# MCMC objects. These are NOT reproducible bit-for-bit, so the slimmed
# versions -- parameter chains and convergence diagnostics, without the
# site-level arrays -- are committed and the full ones are not.
results/mcmc*/*.rds
!results/mcmc*/*_slim.rds
!results/mcmc*/priors_and_options*.rds

# Simulation checkpoints: intermediate state of the 50_* drivers, each
# replicate about 2.6 GB while a run is in progress. The completed
# msom_replicates*.rds carry everything that is used afterwards.
results/**/checkpoints*/

# Figure scripts write PNG only under options(figures.png = TRUE);
# nothing in either manuscript uses it.
figures/*.png

# =====================================================================
# Editor, session and build artefacts
# =====================================================================
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.Renviron
*.Rproj

# LaTeX, in case a manuscript is ever kept inside the repository
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc

# Operating system
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
